<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/18/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The issue is authorised of a sum not exceeding two hundred and forty-nine million five hundred and fifty thousand and nine hundred and fifty (RM249,550,950) from the Consolidated Fund for expenditure on the services specified in the Schedule for the service of the year 1994, not provided for or not fully provided for by the Supply Act 1994 and Supplementary Supply (1993 and 1994) Act 1994."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/18/eng@> .
